15. Counting / Unique Values

| Method           | Use                     | Example                     |
| ---------------- | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |
| `value_counts()` | Count each unique value | `df["City"].value_counts()` |
| `unique()`       | Get unique values       | `df["City"].unique()`       |
| `nunique()`      | Count unique values     | `df["City"].nunique()`      |
| `duplicated()`   | Identify duplicates     | `df["City"].duplicated()`   |


Example:

df["City"].value_counts()

Output might be:

Chennai    50
Mumbai     30
Delhi      20
